The Worker System effectively becomes the MOS equivalent of an operating system kernel.

Traditional OS:

```
Scheduler
Memory Manager
File System
Drivers
```

MOS:

```
Memory Formation
Knowledge Manager
Reflection Engine
Retrieval Optimizer
Learning System
Governance Manager
```

